<div class="marquee-wrapper">
  <div class="marquee-badge">
    <span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE TICKER
  </div>
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <div class="marquee-content">
      <span>🚨 <strong>ANNOUNCEMENT:</strong> Hall Drinking Water Purifiers underwent bi-weekly chemical sanitization</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
      <span>🚌 <strong>TRANSPORT:</strong> Campus Bus morning peak dispatch frequency increased to every 10 minutes</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
      <span>🛡️ <strong>ANTI-RAGGING CELL:</strong> 24/7 Hotline <code>+880-1700-BU-HELP</code> is actively monitored</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
      <span>⚡ <strong>RESOLUTION ENGINE:</strong> 94.8% of reported issues resolved in under 24 hours this week</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
      <span>📚 <strong>LIBRARY:</strong> Central Library 3rd floor Wi-Fi bandwidth doubled for Midterm Exams</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
      <span>🇧🇩 <strong>বরিশাল বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়:</strong> সকল শিক্ষার্থী সমস্যার দ্রুত ও নির্ভরযোগ্য সমাধান নিশ্চিতকরণে আমরা প্রতিশ্রুতিবদ্ধ</span>
      <span class="separator">★</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .marquee-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 40;
    background: var(--pastel-yellow);
    border-bottom: var(--border-width) solid var(--border-black);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    height: 36px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--border-black);
  }
  .marquee-badge {
    background: var(--border-black);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 0 0.85rem;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-retro);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 2px 0px 0px var(--border-black);
  }
  .live-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-block;
    animation: pulseDot 1.5s infinite;
  }
  .marquee-track {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    position: relative;
  }
  .marquee-content {
    display: inline-block;
    padding-left: 100%;
    animation: marqueeScroll 32s linear infinite;
  }
  .marquee-content:hover {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
  .separator {
    margin: 0 1rem;
    color: #e11d48;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @keyframes marqueeScroll {
    0% { transform: translateX(0); }
    100% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
  }
  @keyframes pulseDot {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.75); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .marquee-wrapper {
      height: 32px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }
    .marquee-badge {
      padding: 0 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>

